sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 运维脚本
  participant API as API Server
  participant AL as AsyncLLM
  participant EC as EngineCore
  participant EX as Executor
  participant W0 as Worker rank0
  participant W1 as Worker rank1
  U->>API: POST /start_profile
  API->>AL: start_profile()
  AL->>EC: UTILITY 请求（经 ZMQ，B1）
  EC->>EX: profile(is_start=True)
  EX->>W0: collective_rpc("profile", True)
  EX->>W1: collective_rpc("profile", True)
  W0->>W0: torch.profiler.start()
  W1->>W1: torch.profiler.start()
  Note over U,W1: 压测流量运行若干秒
  U->>API: POST /stop_profile
  API->>EC: 同样路径
  EX->>W0: profile(False) → 导出 trace 到各自文件
  EX->>W1: profile(False) → 导出 trace
